category: Gnome
requires: libglib2.0-devel libtemplate_glib1.0_0 pkg-config
sdesc: "Templating library for GLib (development)"
ldesc: "Template-GLib is a library to help you generate text based on a template and
user defined state. Template-GLib does not use a language runtime, so it is
safe to use from any GObject-Introspectable language."
external-source: template-glib

